WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.520
Trump's invasion force is not going after the worst of the worst, like he said.

00:06.060 --> 00:11.780
They're harassing and detaining many people based only on the color of their skin.

00:12.640 --> 00:17.100
Tamale vendors, delivery people, people looking for work at Home Depot,

00:17.100 --> 00:21.360
and even families just out and about enjoying themselves on a sunny day.

